pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  命名页用一个巨大的“森”字锚定视觉，右侧解释含义与英文命名逻辑，版式保持不对称。
elements:
  - elementId: section-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 44, 3, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$accent" }

  - elementId: section-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 40, 120, 36]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "02"

  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 40, 92, 22]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "03 / 07"

  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 84, 864, 52]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 42
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 命名：MORI / 森野

  - elementId: giant-char
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 150, 270, 330]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 170
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      lineHeight: 0.95
      align: [left, top]
      text: 森

  - elementId: vertical-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [344, 158, 1, 320]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: name-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 158, 522, 44]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 28
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: MORI / 森野

  - elementId: n1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 216, 522, 34]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>森</strong>　三木成林，代表自然的密度与秩序。</p>

  - elementId: n1-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [390, 258, 522, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: n2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 266, 522, 34]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>野</strong>　离开铺装路面之后的状态，也是产品使用场景。</p>

  - elementId: n2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [390, 308, 522, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: n3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 316, 522, 34]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>MORI</strong>　取自日语“森”的读音，短促、中性、便于国际传播。</p>

  - elementId: n3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [390, 358, 522, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: slogan
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 370, 522, 50]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 24
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      text: CITY TO FOREST

  - elementId: slogan-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 420, 522, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 英文标语：从城市到森林，也是从通勤状态到户外状态的切换。
